# The current build loads session-legacy.sav of a main build (SAVE=<out>/session-legacy.sav):
# old bodies get an id, age null, and their three-day lifetime counts from the load.
cheat god
body_traces sample
body_traces check legacy
body_traces view legacy
body_traces hero near
body_traces advance 4320
wait 6000
body_traces check stay-near
body_traces hero far-hidden
wait 6000
body_traces check gone-hidden
quit
